                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Through this government shutdown, the Democrats primary talking point has been extending subsidies for Obamacare - an unmitigated failure that has driven premiums up, while lowering the quality of care for hardworking Americans.\n\nAfter months of unnecessary gridlock, Democrats ultimately agreed to the SAME DEAL they were offered on September 30th.\n\nI commend the eight Senate Democrats who finally recognized the harm this shutdown was causing. Now, we can focus on delivering health care that actually benefits the American people...\n\n\u2b07\ufe0fListen to my full interview with @AVPMikeFerguson below!",
